Icon attribution
----------------

Cloud provider and technology icons are supplied at runtime by the `diagrams`
package (https://github.com/mingrammer/diagrams, MIT), which bundles the
official AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, Kubernetes and Elastic icon sets. Those
icons remain the property of their respective owners and are subject to each
vendor's own trademark and brand guidelines.

The tiles in `archlens/render/assets/` are original to this project. They are
generic role glyphs in approximate brand colours — a card for payments, an
envelope for email — and are deliberately **not** reproductions of any
company's logo.
